<h1 id="s7">7. Flutter Evidence</h1><p>Hospital-side mobile implementation is in <code>mobile/lib/screens/hospital/requests_screen.dart</code> and <code>mobile/lib/screens/hospital/request_detail_screen.dart</code>. The list provides pull-to-refresh, request creation, required-by and status display. The detail screen loads request history and supports hospital-side edit, escalation and withdrawal actions while the request remains in pre-approval states. Form inputs and service calls are handled through the Flutter app’s shared services and validators.</p>
